35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The fixed costs are high. Over 280k yen before fuel.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, that’s a lot. And the other groups failed on favours.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the car is often dirty or low on fuel.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, the fuel receipts show two of us bought most of it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, that’s unfair. I didn’t know that.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, so the split isn’t even. We need to account for that.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, exactly. And checking figures made people feel accused.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, I don’t want to feel accused. I just want reliability.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, reliability costs money. We need to pay for it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I just want a system that doesn’t break down.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, a fixed day system might help.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, but what if someone doesn’t use their day?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, I need my specific weekly trips to be guaranteed.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a booking system could handle that.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, but who records the distance? That takes time.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, the diary shows Saturdays are heavy.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, so a fixed day might not work for weekends.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, I need a primary keeper. Someone responsible.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a primary keeper is a lot of work for one person.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree. It’s too much pressure.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
